# Commit stats and map snapshots with code

When committing in this repo, if the working tree also has churn from departures / reliability / airport connection / temperature / mobile catalog sync / overview or airport map PNGs / sitemap updates, **include those files in the same commit** (or the same push batch) rather than leaving them unstaged.

Do not split “feature code” from incidental `stats:departures` / `sync:data` snapshot updates unless the user explicitly asks to exclude them.

Typical paths: `data/*.json`, `public/data/**`, `public/maps/**`, `mobile/data/**`, `public/sitemap.xml`.
